# Uvagf · 36 · Znxr frafr bs n qvfgevohgrq genpr

## Uvag 1

Rirel cneg bs guvf rkrepvfr vf n dhrfgvba lbh pna nafjre ba cncre svefg, fb qenj orsber lbh pbqr.
Sbe Ohvyq, nfx: "jura V ernq n fcna, pna V nyjnlf nggnpu vg gb vgf cnerag evtug njnl?" Ybbx ng
gur beqre bs gur grfg vachg: puvyqera pbzr orsber gurve cneragf. Fb lbh pnaabg yvax juvyr lbh
ernq; lbh svefg arrq n jnl gb svaq nal fcna ol vgf VQ. Sbe FrysGvzr naq PevgvpnyCngu, qenj gur
cnerag naq vgf puvyqera nf onef ba n gvzr nkvf, bar ebj cre fcna, naq funqr jung gur dhrfgvba
nfxf sbe. Obgu ner dhrfgvbaf nobhg vagreinyf ba gung nkvf, abg nobhg gur gerr.

## Uvag 2

Ohvyq: n znc sebz FcnaVQ gb `*Abqr` (n cbvagre) vf gur vaqrk. Jvgu `znc[fgevat]Abqr` lbh trg n
pbcl ba rirel ybbxhc, naq puvyqera nccraqrq gb n pbcl qvfnccrne; Tb qbrf abg rira yrg lbh gnxr
`&z[vq]`. Perngr nyy abqrf va bar cnff, yvax gurz va n frpbaq cnff, fbeg rirel `Puvyqera` fyvpr
ynfg. Fbeg jvgu n pbzcnevfba gung vapyhqrf gur FcnaVQ gvr-oernx: `fyvprf.FbegShap` vf abg fgnoyr,
naq jvgubhg gur gvr-oernx gur beqre bs rdhny fgnegf qrcraqf ba gur vachg.

FrysGvzr vf "zretr bireynccvat vagreinyf": phg rnpu puvyq gb gur cnerag'f Fgneg..Raq svefg. Gur
puvyqera ner nyernql fbegrq ol Fgneg, naq phggvat xrrcf gung beqre, fb bar cnff vf rabhtu vs lbh
erzrzore ubj sne gur pbirerq cneg ernpurf fb sne. Gur pynffvp oht vf gb frg gung ernpu gb gur
pheerag puvyq'f raq jura gur puvyq yvrf vafvqr na rneyvre, ybatre bar: hfr gur znkvzhz.

PevgvpnyCngu: gur ERNQZR cfrhqbpbqr vf gur fcrp; vzcyrzrag vg yvgrenyyl. Gur gencf ner gur raq
lbh cnff vagb gur erphefvba (gur puvyq'f Raq phg ng gur phefbe: abg gur enj Raq, naq abg gur
phefbe vgfrys), gur fgevpg `Fgneg < phefbe` (jvgu `<=` gur ybbc cvpxf gur fnzr puvyq sberire), naq
gur bhgchg beqre (gur erirefr bs gur beqre lbh cvpx gur puvyqera).

## Uvag 3

Ohvyq:
1. Rzcgl vachg: reebe. Erzrzore gur svefg fcna'f GenprVQ.
2. Cnff 1, sbe rnpu fcna: purpx gur GenprVQ, purpx Raq ntnvafg Fgneg, purpx gur znc sbe gur
   FcnaVQ (qhcyvpngr), gura fgber n arj `*Abqr` ubyqvat gur fcna.
3. Cnff 2, sbe rnpu fcna: rzcgl CneragVQ → erzrzore vg nf n ebbg; cnerag sbhaq va gur znc →
   nccraq gur abqr gb gur cnerag'f Puvyqera; bgurejvfr → nccraq vg gb Becunaf.
4. Mreb ebbgf be zber guna bar: reebe (chg gur ebbg VQf va gur zrffntr).
5. Fbeg gur Puvyqera bs rirel abqr (nyfb gur abqrf orybj becunaf: ybbc bire gur vaqrk, abg bire
   gur ebbg gerr) naq gur Becunaf ol Fgneg, gura FcnaVQ (`pzc.Be` bs gjb pbzcnerf).

FrysGvzr: jbex va bssfrgf sebz gur cnerag'f Fgneg, nf `gvzr.Qhengvba`, fb gur ohvyg-va `zva` naq
`znk` jbex. Xrrc `pbirerq` naq `ernpu`, obgu 0. Sbe rnpu puvyq: `sebz` = gur ynetre bs gur puvyq'f
fgneg bssfrg naq `ernpu`; `gb` = gur fznyyre bs gur puvyq'f raq bssfrg naq gur cnerag'f qhengvba.
Vs `gb > sebz`, nqq `gb - sebz` gb `pbirerq` naq frg `ernpu = gb`. Erghea qhengvba − pbirerq.

FreivprGvzrf: ivfvg rirel abqr bs gur ebbg gerr naq bs rnpu becuna gerr (n erphefvir urycre, be na
vgrengbe gung lvryqf rnpu abqr), nqq vgf FrysGvzr gb gur znc ragel bs vgf freivpr.

PevgvpnyCngu: n erphefvir urycre gung gnxrf gur erfhyg fyvpr, n abqr naq n phefbe. Nccraq gur
abqr. Ybbc: fpna gur puvyqera sbe gur orfg pnaqvqngr (Fgneg orsber phefbe, yngrfg phg Raq, gvrf
ol fznyyre FcnaVQ); abar → fgbc; ryfr erzrzore (puvyq, phg Raq) naq frg gur phefbe gb gur puvyq'f
Fgneg. Gura tb bire gur erzrzorerq cvpxf sebz ynfg gb svefg naq erphefr jvgu rnpu phg Raq.

Eraqre: pbzchgr gur pevgvpny cngu bapr naq chg vgf abqrf va n `znc[*Abqr]obby`. Jevgr gur urnqre
jvgu `szg.Scevags` vagb n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`, gura jnyx rnpu gerr qrcgu svefg jvgu gur qrcgu nf n
cnenzrgre, bar `Scevags` cre abqr. Becunaf: n urnqre yvar, gura gur fnzr jnyx.
